    <h3>Comparison of vulnerability datasets</h3>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Much of the work that proposes new datasets is done in response to perceived flaws in existing datasets, with some articles explicitly refining previous datasets. The datasets show that, while there have been improvements, none of the identified datasets bring together all the recommendations we put forward.</p>
