  <section class="psec" id="trends">
    <h2>Overall Trends</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Our analysis identifies twelve pain points spanning the ML4AVD pipeline and shows that they are not independent: they reinforce each other through feedback loops between datasets, formulations, baselines, and metrics. This integrated view explains the field’s most visible symptom, namely that ML4AVD research remains highly concentrated on binary classification of C/C++ vulnerabilities at the function level.</p>
    </div>

